307	/**
308	 * Permanently remove a certificate record (owner only).
309	 *
310	 * ISSUING is only protected while a job is genuinely running. Before
311	 * 2026-07-26 this refused every ISSUING row unconditionally, so a row stranded
312	 * by a worker restart was permanently undeletable — and because
313	 * requestCertificate rejects a new request while a PENDING/ISSUING/ACTIVE row
