628	  // Deploy-funnel COMPLETION — hosting's authoritative, server-side bottom of the
629	  // funnel, the counterpart to placeOrder / placeGameOrder. Hosting does NOT flow
630	  // through the shared Stripe fulfilment bus (lib/fulfil-checkout.ts has no hosting
631	  // kind — a $0 first month captures a card in `mode:"setup"`, and the charge is the
632	  // wallet debit inside orderHostingAccount), so THIS is its shared success path.
633	  // Recorded here (not on the idempotent-replay early return above) so a retry never
